# Component versions: the only place they are written.
#
# Each component has its own version, and they may diverge: bump only the one
# you change. Read by the Makefile (bridge and relay ldflags, `make bar`),
# macos-bar/build.sh, deploy/relay/deploy.sh, the Wear OS Gradle build,
# herdr-plugin.toml's [[build]] and .github/workflows/release.yml. The
# manifest's `version` field cannot read it: keep it equal to BRIDGE_VERSION
# (`make check-versions` fails when they differ).
#
# The Go binaries add the commit they were built from on their own (format:
# docs/reference/contracts.md §3): never write a commit here.
#
# WEAROS_VERSION_CODE must increase for every build you ship: Android refuses
# to install a lower code over a higher one, and an equal code hides which
# build is on the watch.
#
# Releases: docs/GUIDE.md § Versions and Releases.
#
# Syntax (make's, like agent-watch.env): bare KEY=value lines, no quotes, no
# spaces, comments on their own line.

BRIDGE_VERSION=0.7.0
RELAY_VERSION=0.6.0
MENUBAR_VERSION=0.6.0
WEAROS_VERSION_NAME=1.3.1
WEAROS_VERSION_CODE=12
